on-type="journal">Mohanty, J.G., J.S. Jaffe, E.S. Schulman, and D.G. Raible. <year>1997</year>. A highly sensitive fluorescent micro-assay of H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> release from activated human leukocytes using a dihydroxyphenoxazine derivative. <source>J. Immunol. Methods.</source> <volume>202</volume>:<fpage>133</fpage>&#x02013;141.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9107302</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib34"><citation citation-type="journal">Morris, C.D., and S. Carson. <year>2003</year>. Routine vitamin supplementation to prevent cardiovascular disease: a summary of the evidence for the U.S. Preventive Services Task Force. <source>Ann. Intern. Med.</source> <volume>139</volume>:<fpage>56</fpage>&#x02013;70.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12834320</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib35"><citation citation-type="journal">Nedeljkovic, Z.S., N. Gokce, and J. Loscalzo. <year>2003</year>. Mechanisms of oxidative stress and vascular dysfunction. <source>Postgrad. Med. J.</source> <volume>79</volume>:<fpage>195</fpage>&#x02013;199&#x0003b; quiz 198&#x02013;200.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12743334</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib36"><citation citation-type="journal">Papapetropoulos, A., G. Garcia-Cardena, J.A. Madri, and W.C. Sessa. <year>1997</year>. Nitric oxide production contributes to the angiogenic properties of vascular endothelial growth factor in human endothelial cells. <source>J. Clin. Invest.</source> <volume>100</volume>:<fpage>3131</fpage>&#x02013;3139.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9399960</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib37"><citation citation-type="journal">Pevsner, J., S.C. Hsu, J.E. Braun, N. Calakos, A.E. Ting, M.K. Bennett, and R.H. Scheller. <year>1994</year>. Specificity and regulation of a synaptic vesicle docking complex. <source>Neuron.</source> <volume>13</volume>:<fpage>353</fpage>&#x02013;361.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8060616</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib38"><citation citation-type="journal">Sollner, T.H. <year>2003</year>. Regulated exocytosis and SNARE function (Review). <source>Mol. Membr. Biol.</source> <volume>20</volume>:<fpage>209</fpage>&#x02013;220.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12893529</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib39"><citation citation-type="journal">Sollner, T.H., and S. Sequeira. <year>2003</year>. S-nitrosylation of NSF controls membrane trafficking. <source>Cell.</source> <volume>115</volume>:<fpage>127</fpage>&#x02013;129.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14567907</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib40"><citation citation-type="journal">Sundaresan, M., Z.X. Yu, V.J. Ferrans, K. Irani, and T. Finkel. <year>1995</year>. Requirement for generation of H2O2 for platelet-derived growth factor signal transduction. <source>Science.</source> <volume>270</volume>:<fpage>296</fpage>&#x02013;299.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7569979</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib41"><citation citation-type="journal">Ushio-Fukai, M., R.W. Alexander, M. Akers, and K.K. Griendling. <year>1998</year>. p38 mitogen-activated protein kinase is a critical component of the redox-sensitive signaling pathways activated by angiotensin II. Role in vascular smooth muscle cell hypertrophy. <source>J. Biol. Chem.</source> <volume>273</volume>:<fpage>15022</fpage>&#x02013;15029.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9614110</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib42"><citation citation-type="journal">Virtamo, J., J.M. Rapola, S. Ripatti, O.P. Heinonen, P.R. Taylor, D. Albanes, and J.K. Huttunen. <year>1998</year>. Effect of vitamin E and beta carotene on the incidence of primary nonfatal myocardial infarction and fatal coronary heart disease. <source>Arch. Intern. Med.</source> <volume>158</volume>:<fpage>668</fpage>&#x02013;675.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9521232</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib43"><citation citation-type="journal">Vischer, U.M., and D.D. Wagner. <year>1993</year>. CD63 is a component of Weibel-Palade bodies of human endothelial cells. <source>Blood.</source> <volume>82</volume>:<fpage>1184</fpage>&#x02013;1191.<